{
  "message": "I can help with that. To pull up your reservation, please provide: 1) Your user ID, and 2) Your reservation ID. If you don’t have the reservation ID, I can look it up once I have your user ID.",
  "important_notes": [
    "Flight modifications must keep the same origin, destination, and trip type. So I can change your ATL→PHL flight to the next day. If you prefer arriving at EWR instead, that would require booking a new reservation rather than modifying the current one."
  ],
  "next_steps": [
    "Tell me your user ID and reservation ID (or give me permission to look up the reservation after you share your user ID).",
    "Confirm whether you want to proceed with modifying to PHL for the next day, or have me price a new ATL→EWR option for that date.",
    "If we change flights, let me know which stored payment method (a single credit card or gift card on your profile) to use for any fare difference or refund."
  ]
}

